CHECKSUM="1868367ec0dbaaef5ab745fb45c25d7adfa189f82527f96c2f8fb11c2b97fc4c"
	#=========================================================================================*
	# Name                         	:   LoanDisbursement.scr
	# Date                         	:   20-06-2009
	# Description                  	:   To Disburse the loan amount to the given account no.
	# Input                        	:   All the details required to disburse the loan amount.
	# Output                       	:   Success or failure message for disbursement
	# Author                       	:   Revathi Duraisamy
	# Called Scripts               	:   <none>
	# Calling Script               	:   <none>
	# Reference                    	:
	# Modification History  		:
	#  <Serial No.>  <Date>         <AuthorName>          	<Description>
